diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index ae36e1f..a036ef2 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,5 +1,40 @@
 # 🏗 Scaffold-ETH 2
 
+## USDC Payouts (this project)
+
+A dApp for sending USDC payouts to teammates and contributors on **Base mainnet** (chain id 8453).
+
+- `Payouts.sol` pulls USDC from the sender via `transferFrom` and emits a `Paid` event with an optional memo.
+- The `/payouts` page handles the approve → pay flow and renders the onchain payout feed.
+- USDC (`0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913`) lives in `packages/nextjs/contracts/externalContracts.ts`.
+  Do not move it into `deployedContracts.ts` — that file is regenerated on every `yarn deploy`.
+
+### Before deploying the frontend
+
+Set both in Vercel/system env, otherwise the app falls back to the shared Scaffold-ETH demo keys,
+which are rate limited and not suitable for real traffic:
+
+```
+NEXT_PUBLIC_ALCHEMY_API_KEY=
+NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLET_CONNECT_PROJECT_ID=
+```
+
+### Deployment records
+
+`packages/nextjs/contracts/deployedContracts.ts` is fully regenerated from `packages/hardhat/deployments/`
+on every `yarn deploy`. That directory was missing, so any local deploy silently dropped the live Base
+address from the frontend. `packages/hardhat/deployments/base/Payouts.json` has been reconstructed from the
+compiled artifact of the committed source plus the address and deploy block that were already recorded in
+`deployedContracts.ts`. The original deploy transaction/receipt hashes were not available, so only
+`receipt.blockNumber` is present. Keep this directory committed for every live network.
+
+### Known limitation
+
+The payout feed uses `useScaffoldEventHistory`, which polls `eth_getLogs`. It starts from the contract's
+`deployedOnBlock`, so it is cheap today, but the cost grows with chain height. Move it to an indexer
+(ponder/subgraph) before the feed gets large.
+
+
 <h4 align="center">
   <a href="https://docs.scaffoldeth.io">Documentation</a> |
   <a href="https://scaffoldeth.io">Website</a>
